@startuml
title Portfolio Automation Strategy - 자동화 운영 구조

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Malgun Gothic

actor User
participant "Codex" as Codex
participant "Notion\nPortfolio Dashboard" as Notion
participant "Google Calendar" as Calendar
participant "GitHub" as GitHub
participant "GitHub Actions\nUnity CI/CD" as CI
participant "Docs / PlantUML" as Docs

== Architecture Governance Review ==

User -> Codex : 새로운 기능 아이디어
Codex -> Notion : Backlog / KPI / Risk 확인
Codex -> Docs : Architecture / Naming / Assembly 확인
Codex -> Codex : 의존성 / ModuleHub / Assembly 영향 분석
Codex -> User : Approved / Conditional / Rejected 보고

alt Approved
  Codex -> Notion : Architecture Review Log 기록
else Rejected or Conditional
  Codex -> Notion : 보류 사유 / 조건 기록
end

== Implementation + CI/CD ==

User -> Codex : 기능 구현 요청
Codex -> GitHub : Commit / Push 후보
GitHub -> CI : GitHub Actions 실행
CI -> CI : Compile / Test / Build
CI -> GitHub : 결과 기록
Codex -> Notion : Build/Test/Docs/UML 상태 반영

== Weekly Technical Review ==

Calendar -> Codex : Weekly Review 일정
Codex -> GitHub : Commit / 변경사항 확인
Codex -> Docs : Markdown / PlantUML Coverage 확인
Codex -> Notion : Journal / Blog / Interview 상태 확인
Codex -> Codex : Progress / Debt / Next Goals 분석
Codex -> Notion : Weekly Technical Review 작성
Codex -> Calendar : 다음 주 일정 수정 제안

@enduml
